>> Network Discovery Traffic (mDNS / WS-Discovery):
Question: When I click the "Add Printer" button on my computer, it shows many available printers. How does my computer find and display them?

Broadcast / Network Discovery: 
When I click "Add Printer," my computer sends out a local discovery message across the subnet asking: "Are there any printers or shared resources available?"
The Host Responds: 
The printer hears this message and replies directly to my computer: "Yes, I am a printer, and my name is 'Office-Printer'!"









 






